OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 'inspirational'
OL,4,ACiara Mageean after death at 34
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to former
OL,7,FEuropean champion and two-time Olympic
OL,8,Frunner Ciara Mageean, who has died at
OL,9,Fthe age of 34.
OL,11,FMageean, from Portaferry in County
OL,12,FDown, was diagnosed with stage four
OL,13,Fbowel cancer in May 2025.
OL,15,FShe died on Sunday morning, surrounded
OL,16,Fby her loved ones, a statement posted
OL,17,Fon her social media accounts said.
OL,19,F"A beloved daughter, sister, wife,
OL,20,Ffriend and inspiration to so many, she
OL,21,Fwill be deeply missed," it said.
